#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:5
#: b697434fd2d6415297080d633a956c25
msgid "ReefMaster"
msgstr "ReefMaster"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:10
#: c7b267ae9d4b4525a35836afd23f52d1
msgid ""
"`ReefMaster <https://reefmaster.com.au/>`__ is a popular tool for analysing "
"sonar data.  This page provides steps for uploading sonar data collected by "
"an ArduPilot drone boat to ReefMaster to produce 2D and 3D maps."
msgstr ""
"`ReefMaster <https://reefmaster.com.au/>`__ 是一款常用的声呐数据分析工具。本页介绍如何将 ArduPilot"
" 无人船采集的声呐数据上传至 ReefMaster，以生成二维和三维地图。"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:12
#: decc41d762054613a5cae87af901fed1
msgid ""
"Note that these instructions apply to boats with a sonar directly connected "
"to the autopilot and the lidar is providing only simple distances.  "
"ArduPilot does not yet support directly consuming sidescan or backscatter "
"data from a sonar."
msgstr "请注意，本说明适用于声呐直接连接飞控且激光雷达仅提供简单距离的船。ArduPilot 目前尚不支持直接读取来自声呐的侧扫或背散射数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:15
#: 52312c75db3b47f19898ab5411f5148c
msgid "Steps before Mapping"
msgstr "测图前准备步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:17
#: bc8e68be207c41b3a9fa4e110722b668
msgid ""
"The vehicle should be :ref:`setup as a boat <boat-configuration>` meaning "
":ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` should be set to \"2\" (Boat)"
msgstr ""
"车辆应 :ref:`配置为船 <boat-configuration>`，即 :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` 应设为 "
"「2」（Boat）"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:18
#: f74013b7ded946a4859cf3cb2fd6e3c3
msgid ""
"The :ref:`sonar <common-underwater-sonars-landingpage>` should be directly "
"connected to the autopilot with :ref:`RNGFNDx_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>`  = "
"\"25\" (Down)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`声呐 <common-underwater-sonars-landingpage>` 应直接连接到飞控，并将 "
":ref:`RNGFNDx_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` 设为 「25」（向下）"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:19
#: 4d91c97dac7143f4884d15508fa8386d
msgid ""
":ref:`Onboard logs <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` can be large so ensure the autopilot has a good quality SD card "
"inserted with sufficient space (8GB or larger is a good choice)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`机载日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>` "
"文件可能较大，请确保飞控插入了高质量、容量足够的 SD 卡（建议 8GB 或更大）"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:22
#: 42005741f4144ecfa60cdaed9a509ca5
msgid "Extract DPTH messages from the Onboard Log"
msgstr "从机载日志中提取 DPTH 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:24
#: 3bc344bbcbca4ec6b8c5a2932919167a
msgid ""
":ref:`Download the Onboard Logs over MAVLink <common-downloading-and-"
"analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>` or eject the autopilot's SD card, "
"insert it into your PC and directly copy the .BIN files from the APM/LOGS "
"directory to your PC"
msgstr ""
":ref:`通过 MAVLink 下载机载日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-"
"mission-planner>`，或弹出飞控的 SD 卡插入电脑，直接将 APM/LOGS 目录下的 .BIN 文件复制到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:25
#: 847d4fd9a3aa4a79aa3fc259259504a1
msgid ""
"Open the .BIN file using Mission Planner's Data >> DataFlash Logs >> Review "
"a Log feature"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 的「数据 >> DataFlash 日志 >> 查看日志」功能打开 .BIN 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:26
#: f020140ab9ac43c5818779577b161a66
msgid ""
"Check the \"Data Table\" checkbox, then click anywhere on the data table's "
"column header and select \"DPTH\" from the drop-down and push the \"Filter\""
" button"
msgstr "勾选「数据表」复选框，在数据表列标题处单击并从下拉菜单中选择「DPTH」，然后点击「Filter」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:31
#: 1a188528e60f437d9ed6fdfa31bae378
msgid ""
"Right-mouse-button-click in the data area and select \"Export Visible\" and "
"save to a .csv file"
msgstr "在数据区域右键单击，选择「Export Visible」，保存为 .csv 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:37
#: 61be7e60f90b4772948338fad482cb5d
msgid "Import to ReefMaster"
msgstr "导入到 ReefMaster"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:39
#: 7927db19d74e45dabcebed129b502c6a
msgid "Open ReefMaster and create a new workspace"
msgstr "打开 ReefMaster 并新建工作区"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:40
#: 1374140dcb5e4861b39552104cdfb776
msgid ""
"Select File, Import Logs and Waypoints, Browse and select the CSV file "
"produced above"
msgstr "选择「File」→「Import Logs and Waypoints」→「Browse」，选择上面生成的 CSV 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:41
#: 649f4e90d0324e81971e7c62c11f4443
msgid ""
"On the \"Import Options\" window set the following fields and then push the "
"check button"
msgstr "在「Import Options」窗口中设置以下字段，然后点击确认按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:43
#: e8e72309a4cf483f96641afa931acfad
msgid "Separator: Comma"
msgstr "分隔符：逗号"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:44
#: 2c321104085745b8896a3a5ff9f57d0c
msgid "Latitude: 6"
msgstr "纬度：6"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:45
#: 10f6fa64a0bc4cd2b2c1309332c9918f
msgid "Longitude: 7"
msgstr "经度：7"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:46
#: 6045fb1064ea40b285a16c2b54347e2b
msgid "Depth: 8"
msgstr "深度：8"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:51
#: 7517f3044cbd4b8a93dad46f094aa490
msgid ""
"The \"Import GPS Assets\" window should appear next, press the check button "
"on the bottom right"
msgstr "接下来应出现「Import GPS Assets」窗口，点击右下角的确认按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:52
#: 02ec3f5a262f4107a748de82e129ff5a
msgid "Press the arrow on the top left to return to the main view"
msgstr "点击左上角的返回箭头回到主视图"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:53
#: d5cd6f13669f42f1b388179e3a42ac8d
msgid ""
"Under \"Tracks\", right-mouse-button-click on the new track and \"Add Track "
"to Map Project\" >> \"New Project\".  The sonar data should appear on the "
"map."
msgstr ""
"在「Tracks」下，右键单击新航迹并选择「Add Track to Map Project」>>「New Project」，声呐数据将显示在地图上。"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:59
#: fbcdf4ef3e034f2a968ee56b5fdde8a8
msgid "Creating 2D/3D maps"
msgstr "创建二维/三维地图"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:61
#: 9643faf39c7243a2819da5cf2ec6fceb
msgid "Under \"Project\", push \"Define Map Area\" and select an area with sonar data"
msgstr "在「Project」下，点击「Define Map Area」并选取包含声呐数据的区域"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:66
#: aba800ea66c647eea9392ae6888459e1
msgid "Push \"Generate Map\" and \"Map View\" buttons to produce a 2D map"
msgstr "点击「Generate Map」和「Map View」按钮生成二维地图"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:71
#: d971995830bd4bc1a980804c02e138f2
msgid "Push \"3D View\" to produce a 3D map"
msgstr "点击「3D View」生成三维地图"

#: ../../source/docs/reefmaster-for-bathymetry.rst:76
#: bb3c625123b2429c8c24070172a4c518
msgid ""
"Push \"Export\" >> \"Export Map Project\" to create images or Google Earth "
"KMZ files"
msgstr "点击「Export」>>「Export Map Project」以创建图像或 Google Earth KMZ 文件"
